    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Key new features in Service Fabric release 7.2 include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li>The ability to place multiple stateless instances on a single node.</li>\r\n\t<li>Enhanced resource governance.</li>\r\n\t<li>Run to completion for replicas.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/service-fabric/blob/master/release_notes/Service-Fabric-72-releasenotes.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Release notes</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/azure-service-fabric/azure-service-fabric-7-2-release/ba-p/1805653\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blog post</a></p>\r\n",
